- Run `git`, `hc`, `hk`, `pnpm`, `crit`, `ctx7`, `herdr`, and `./gradlew` as standalone Bash calls, without `&&`, `;`, pipes, or `$(...)`. They are in `sandbox.excludedCommands`, which only applies when the whole command matches, so a combined command runs inside the sandbox and fails. For `git commit`, pass the message with one `-m` per paragraph instead of `"$(cat <<'EOF' ... EOF)"`.
